multiflexi-eventor (0.2.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  [ vitex ]
  * Move EventSource/EventRule domain classes to multiflexi-core
  * EventProcessor engine with poll/match/schedule loop

  [ Vítězslav Dvořák ]
  * Ship root composer.json as the deb runtime descriptor instead of
    debian/conf/composer.json, using vitexsoftware/* package names so
    composer-debian resolves multiflexi-core and the eventor vendor
    autoloader is populated again.
  * Ship a static autoloader (system package autoloaders + PSR-4 +
    InstalledVersions) and point daemon.php at it, instead of a
    composer-debian /var/lib/composer vendor dir that was never
    populated (daemon failed to start with missing autoload.php).

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 08 Jun 2026 16:16:03 +0200

multiflexi-eventor (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of MultiFlexi Event Processor.
  * Poll webhook adapter databases for cached change events.
  * Match events against configurable rules.
  * Schedule MultiFlexi jobs via multiflexi-cli.

